      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAINT FRANKLIN (4) ran above expectations to claim maiden two back then finished second last start and beaten 4 lengths at Shepparton over 390m (22.74). Returns to the scene of his maiden win. Going well and can find winning form this time. BOMBER'S JACK (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (20.72) at this track in a Rank Limit - Grade 6. Can turn it around this time. STILL A BELIEVER (8) was an effortless winner two back scoring by 1.3 lengths then well held latest finishing a 10 length 7th at Warragul (23.99). Form from his last run is proving strong. Has the ability to give this a shake. TAYLOR'S GIRL (7) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
